<section class="cc-about" id="about">
  <div class="cc-about-inner">
    <figure class="cc-about-fig">
      <img
        src="/media/library/jacob-tree-hi.webp"
        alt="Jacob Vermeulen"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="cc-about-text">
      <div class="cc-eyebrow">About Jacob</div>
      <h2 class="cc-h2" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4); max-width: 22ch;">
        The teacher <em>and the path.</em>
      </h2>

      <p>
        Jacob Vermeulen is the founder of Somatic Vocal Healing and the
        Sound Constellation method. Over the past years he has guided
        thousands of students worldwide through this work — through
        workshops, the 12-week foundational course, the certification
        training, and the ongoing live deepening sessions.
      </p>
      <p>
        His teaching is direct, embodied, and rooted in his own life. He
        doesn't claim to have learned this from books. He learned it the
        way most real things are learned — by going through it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cc-cofacilitator">
    <div class="cc-cofacilitator-inner">
      <div class="cc-eyebrow">Co-facilitator</div>
      <h3 class="cc-cofacilitator-name">Karen Evans</h3>
      <p>
        Karen walks alongside Jacob on the course — hosting Q&amp;As on the
        weeks he isn't on the call, and holding the field with care. A
        long-time practitioner herself, she knows this work from the inside,
        and what it asks of you as you learn to hold it for others.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
